--- !u!114 &1684011896
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 859860215}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7bfe88a1dd63542739086a9c9935c46a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Lalim.Mechanics.StatueDialogueRouter
  _deityName: Neguno
  _questLines:
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: So. A child of the land comes to my waters. Do you know what happened to
      the last one who came here only to take?
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: '{player}'
    text: "\u2026No."
    isPlayer: 1
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: His name was Kablay. He owned many boats, and rented them to poor fishers
      for more than they could ever pay.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: When famine came, an old beggar knocked on his door. Kablay told him to
      go and jump into the sea.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: The beggar was me. That night my storm took his house, and the sea took
      Kablay. He became the first shark.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: 'Kablay is gone, but his greed is not. Look: nets cast and abandoned, still
      fishing with no one left to haul them in.'
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: My creatures are tangled in them. Undo the knots, free every one, and pull
      those nets out of my sea.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: Do this, and I will open the deep path.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  _closingLines:
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: The deep path is open. Swim down, {player}. Other waters are waiting for
      someone like you.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  _idleLines:
  - speakerName: Neguno
    text: The deep path is open. Do not keep it waiting.
    isPlayer: 0
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  _barks:
  - key: relic_gift
    lines:
    - speakerName: Neguno
      text: Free. Every one of them. You came to give, not to take. That is rarer
        than pearls.
      isPlayer: 0
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - speakerName: Neguno
      text: Here. A piece of a net woven by honest hands, made to take only what
        is needed and let the rest swim free.
      isPlayer: 0
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - speakerName: Neguno
      text: Kablay never understood the difference. Carry it, and remember it.
      isPlayer: 0
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - speakerName: '{player}'
      text: I will.
      isPlayer: 1
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
  _talkPoint: {fileID: 2045622455}
  _dugongPoint: {fileID: 1202926037}
  _talkCamera: {fileID: 2007679581}
  _frameWithin: 30
  _fadeSeconds: 0.35
  onIntroComplete:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
